  "title": "TOP SUBMISSIONS EP1 In October, 2022",
  "htmlContent": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>TOP SUBMISSIONS EP1 In October, 2022. We are still dedicated to showcasing the best tracks from the underground by searching far and wide in order to bring you our weekly list.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It’s a tough job as we sift through a ton of high-quality tracks just to settle for just 10 so we switched it up so now we curating the Top Submissions. Now that is what we call dedication, so sit back relax and get familiar with these acts. Remember, don’t forget to support them by sharing their works.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Kyle M Watson - WHAT NOW (Triggered)</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/5q8QPxIYn1XUl9xDiuPlVj\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"spotify\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-21-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-spotify wp-block-embed-spotify wp-embed-aspect-21-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://open.spotify.com/track/5q8QPxIYn1XUl9xDiuPlVj\n</div><figcaption><strong>Kyle M Watson&nbsp;</strong>steps it up on his latest release “WHAT NOW (Triggered)”. He&nbsp;gives you all the lyrical heat, you could need as he’s perfect in his articulation the record. The beat sets the tone just right, to handle his perfect storm of R&amp;B, complimented by the melodic chorus that takes the song to another level<br></figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Released date: &nbsp;Oct 01, 2022</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Tru Frass and TropicalMariana - Lost</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/album/0DmrNGP4rnLnBTFO8u55Tc?si=6b5786de64bf46cd\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"spotify\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-21-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-spotify wp-block-embed-spotify wp-embed-aspect-21-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://open.spotify.com/album/0DmrNGP4rnLnBTFO8u55Tc?si=6b5786de64bf46cd\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tru Frass and TropicalMariana's - \"Lost\" is the perfect record to showcase the art of R&amp;B music. The pictures the music creates is everything that makes people be able to dream to the music, with a sound you can get lost in with the endless vibes of the record. Hit play on this record now and take in the incredible sound from&nbsp;<strong>Tru Frass and TropicalMariana</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Released date: &nbsp;Sep 30, 2022</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Adri'd - Emo (feat. Rhonii Dee)</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/03IezJjPnURYbDHaERpERD\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"spotify\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-21-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-spotify wp-block-embed-spotify wp-embed-aspect-21-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://open.spotify.com/track/03IezJjPnURYbDHaERpERD\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Adri'd and Rhonii Dee creates a mainstream sound that is truly mesmerizing with his new song “Imo”. This talented artist makes a fun record that can brighten any day, as they takes you on a journey of musical bliss, you never knew you needed but everything you could possibly ask for and more. The production is stellar as well as the vocal performance, with great songwriting that makes it a must hear smash.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Released date: &nbsp;Sep 30, 2022</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Swift Fox - Sad Again</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/37A8xnJOFrKwrICPWjD1Bp\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"spotify\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-21-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-spotify wp-block-embed-spotify wp-embed-aspect-21-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://open.spotify.com/track/37A8xnJOFrKwrICPWjD1Bp\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Swift Fox's \"Sad Again\" is your new favorite record that is waiting for you to press play. It’s that music that is fresh, ad makes you want to dive in to see what else he has in store, as he drops some of his finest work to date on this must hear record.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Released date: Apr 22, 2021</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>RIGHTSTARTER - Write My Eulogy in Blood</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/4WkrqaEmpa4dDXPZyr4MmO\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"spotify\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-21-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-spotify wp-block-embed-spotify wp-embed-aspect-21-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://open.spotify.com/track/4WkrqaEmpa4dDXPZyr4MmO\n</div><figcaption>RIGHTSTARTER's \"Write My Eulogy in Blood\" is a musical masterpiece that is second to none. It does everything right to make an amazing sound, that anyone who listens will enjoy. The star power of&nbsp;<strong>RIGHTSTARTER</strong>&nbsp;is on full bloom, and shines ot the fullest on this special record you need to add to your life now.</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Released date: Sep 30, 2022</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Hak Black - Use Your Time</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/6jkGzDhnOeH07fBsT9VU03\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"spotify\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-21-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-spotify wp-block-embed-spotify wp-embed-aspect-21-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://open.spotify.com/track/6jkGzDhnOeH07fBsT9VU03\n</div><figcaption>Hak Black's \"Use Your Time\" is the type of record that puts the fun in music, and makes you want to groove for time to come. The level of musicianship is undeniable and can only be admired and appreciated from critics and fans alike.</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Released date: Sep 30, 2022</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Light. - Black Swan</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ywj35C_hDB4\",\"type\":\"video\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"youtube\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ywj35C_hDB4\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Light.'s \"Black Swan\" is that fearless Hip Hop that gives the people what they need to hear. Everything about this record is amazing and captivating with hard rhymes, accompanied with a raw flow flourishing to make something that you can keep on repeat and rock out to. If you want the real in your music, listen to this track now!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Released date: Sep 30, 2022</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Zaug - Hero</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/4rSyTvVbWgMFAWD6oKCFOS\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"spotify\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-21-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-spotify wp-block-embed-spotify wp-embed-aspect-21-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://open.spotify.com/track/4rSyTvVbWgMFAWD6oKCFOS\n</div><figcaption>Zaug and Just AL's \"Hero\" is bold display of Hip Hop that makes you respect his artistry to the fullest. You can’t deny them for a second as they boats their lyrical prowess, in a real way for their fans everywhere. If you’re looking for a super dope record, you can end you perch with this super dope artist.</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Released date: Sep 30, 2022</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>LittleBoBxxbz - Turn this bitch up.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/4UVkMvAljM1flMAUW51Qpz\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"spotify\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-21-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-spotify wp-block-embed-spotify wp-embed-aspect-21-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://open.spotify.com/track/4UVkMvAljM1flMAUW51Qpz\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>LittleBoBxxbz and Serious Bests's \"Turn this bitch up.\" is the music that you hear, that helps you stay in course for your dreams. They ups their game and holds nothing back, as they gives their fans supreme work and puts the game on notice that they are here and better than ever.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Released date: Sep 20, 2022</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Prime Sinister - Barium (Prod. Prime Sinister)</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/album/1lf426q11OX3MOewypndKf?si=cde9d46b0e7e42b6\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"spotify\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-21-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-spotify wp-block-embed-spotify wp-embed-aspect-21-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://open.spotify.com/album/1lf426q11OX3MOewypndKf?si=cde9d46b0e7e42b6\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Prime Sinister's \"<strong>Barium</strong>\" is not only an impressive record, but a modern day masterpiece that connects in a real way. He gives it all to the music, and it resonates to perfection to make every moving aspect of the song enjoyable for every second. This a must hear record from a must hear talent, that anyone who enjoys good music should make room for now.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Released date: Sep 25, 2022</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
